== Participate
Graduate students, postdoctoral researchers, faculty, and research staff from UTK and neighboring institutions are invited to attend and present. We welcome talks on completed or ongoing research, emerging ideas, methods, tools, datasets, and recent papers within the meetup's scope. If you would like to give a talk or suggest a topic or speaker, please contact one of the organizers through the links above.

Please check this page for schedule updates.
